dissimulate, dissipate, dissociate, make -lable, -pable, -ciable; see -ABLE 1.
===
**dissimulate, dissipate, dissociate,** make *-lable, -pable, -ciable*; see ^^-ABLE^^ 1.
>>>

<<<
dissociation. See -CIATION.
===
**dissociation.** See ^^-CIATION^^.
>>>

<<<
dissoluble, dissolvable. 1. Pronounce di’soloobl, dizð’'lvabl.
===
**dissoluble, dissolvable. 1.** Pronounce dĭ'solo͝obl, dĭzŏ'lvabl.
>>>

<<<
2. Dissoluble is the established word, & may be used in all senses; but dissoluable often represents dissolve when it means make a solution
===
**2.** *Dissoluble* is the established word, & may be used in all senses; but *dissolvable* often represents *dissolve* when it means make a solution
>>>

